const shuffled = <T,>(arr: T[], seed: number) => { const rnd = seeded(seed); const a = [...arr]; for (let i = a.length - 1; i > 0; i--) { const j = Math.floor(rnd() * (i + 1)); const ai = a[i], aj = a[j]; if (ai !== undefined && aj !== undefined) { a[i] = aj; a[j] = ai; } } return a; };

